ble of quick dodges and fast attacks, or the slower one with a stronger cannon? As you progress, the invaders become faster and more challenging, pushing your reflexes to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick one of 2 tanks for defending Earth:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170700/extras/b518d146b291cc3c435ecfb8502fb040.poster.avif?t=1753409239\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170700/extras/b518d146b291cc3c435ecfb8502fb040.webm?t=1753409239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170700/extras/b518d146b291cc3c435ecfb8502fb040.mp4?t=1753409239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun blasting through asteroids, crushing bricks, and saving Earth from alien invasions in this tiny arcade collection!</strong></p>",
